{"data": [{"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-08-26T02:47:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2092443828435509293"], "id": "2092443828435509293", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 19970, "like_count": 84, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 97, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "放假在家就干三件事：吃饭 睡觉 自慰", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2092443828435509293"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-08-26T02:24:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2092437912713580901"], "id": "2092437912713580901", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 669, "impression_count": 505812, "like_count": 5072, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 583, "retweet_count": 36}, "text": "看片的时候被日女萌晕了。前一秒还被逼得从喉咙深处挤出低吼，声音又沉又哑，听着就感觉人快被撞懵了；下一秒男方一停，她也软下来，脆生生地冒出一句甜甜的“达咩”。好可爱的，我直接被甜晕。", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2092437912713580901"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-08-25T14:51:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2092263726900723850"], "id": "2092263726900723850", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 12450, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "对不起我已读不回 我不是故意要看到的", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2092263726900723850"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-08-25T13:53:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2092249114440523882"], "id": "2092249114440523882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 13888, "like_count": 19, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 24, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "上课遇到一个学生时不时发出奇怪笑声。第一次是我讲完题在问学生听懂了没，他突然“嘿嘿”笑了两声，我问他是哪里不懂吗？他摇摇头。第二次是学生写题时他又笑了两声，我问他是不是哪里不舒服，他说没有。第三次是学生在提问，他又突然笑了两声。问他为什么又笑，他直勾勾看着我，也不说话。\n好诡异。", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2092249114440523882"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-08-24T16:17:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2091922903264878622"], "id": "2091922903264878622", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16952, "like_count": 73, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 33, "retweet_count": 18}, "text": "我的社交方式就是一直等待某人点开我的聊天框", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2091922903264878622"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-08-23T15:10:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2091543673662239179"], "id": "2091543673662239179", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 9771, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "有个用了很久的小玩具，特别好用也很爱用。可惜最近坏掉了，于是买了个新的同款。新玩具到手后却觉得特别难用，完全没有旧的好用……难道玩具也有磨合期？", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2091543673662239179"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-08-23T02:11:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2091347496471859396"], "id": "2091347496471859396", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8872, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "人如果能像猫一样用头蹭喜欢的人来标记气味就好了，我要把喜欢的人身上蹭满自己的味道", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2091347496471859396"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-08-22T04:19:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2091017490122031358"], "id": "2091017490122031358", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 9679, "like_count": 33, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "手枪腿 https://t.co/b2uLW7xwMn", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2091017490122031358"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-08-20T15:05:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2090455258875207836"], "id": "2090455258875207836", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9427, "like_count": 18, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 42, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "吮指原味鸡为什么那么咸 咬一口要喝三口水 我买了八个 现在还剩下七个该怎么办", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2090455258875207836"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-08-20T13:14:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2090427155654348976"], "id": "2090427155654348976", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7053, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "妈妈跳过催婚，开始催生了，理由是她想照顾小孩\n我：那你去幼儿园找份兼职吧。效果一样的，还有钱拿，一举多得。", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2090427155654348976"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-08-19T15:22:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2090097192048705915"], "id": "2090097192048705915", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 77344, "like_count": 1797, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 247, "retweet_count": 9}, "text": "看了山东公园的视频，太恐怖了。那个男人像是突然应激了一样大吼大叫，上一秒还能正常交流，下一秒就异化成了一个炸弹。感觉女生直接被吓懵了，一直道歉是想尽快息事宁人，赶紧远离发疯的男人吧…", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2090097192048705915"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-08-18T16:46:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2089755850986717332"], "id": "2089755850986717332", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6327, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "卡泡听起来好累 感觉双方的舌头都在嘴巴里舞出残影了 那些吮吸声 口交声到底咋发出来的", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2089755850986717332"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-08-17T14:25:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2089358067121209430"], "id": "2089358067121209430", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6139, "like_count": 11, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 15, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "朋友问我放假在家一整天都干了什么\n我：很多事情可以做呀 比如….\n实际上我在家一整天干的事情只有自慰", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2089358067121209430"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-08-15T16:08:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2088659047033790964"], "id": "2088659047033790964", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 8611, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 31, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "在反复观看裴珠泫醉酒撒娇那一段视频 完全是犯罪啊女人 犯了勾引我的罪 \n再冷漠的人看完也会无法自拔爱上她！", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2088659047033790964"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-08-15T11:08:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2088583729392631986"], "id": "2088583729392631986", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 11, "impression_count": 35466, "like_count": 106, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 21, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "一怒之下我站起来了，两眼一黑我又坐下了。 https://t.co/fSQKx6jKQI", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2088583729392631986"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-08-15T00:45:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2088426776100053213"], "id": "2088426776100053213", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6680, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "一直在努力隐藏评论里机器人的回复，因为我点开看到一群看福/福不黑的就会很恼火。结果隐藏完大号是看不到机器人评论了，切小号看发现还有一堆，真的很烦啊！", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2088426776100053213"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-08-13T18:19:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2087967352147292640"], "id": "2087967352147292640", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 209, "impression_count": 572156, "like_count": 3303, "quote_count": 38, "reply_count": 368, "retweet_count": 101}, "text": "严肃学习中 https://t.co/oZPdc84kNZ", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2087967352147292640"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-08-13T14:32:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2087910116406472981"], "id": "2087910116406472981", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6645, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 21, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "我喜欢把所有水果都放/切在碗里端着吃", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2087910116406472981"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-08-12T15:45:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2087566125408362686"], "id": "2087566125408362686", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7107, "like_count": 22, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 30, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "终于申诉回来了呜呜呜太不容易了", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2087566125408362686"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-08-06T08:20:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2085279914404835718"], "id": "2085279914404835718", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 6979, "like_count": 12, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 10, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "什么时候能研究出共感的玩具呢 我很需要", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2085279914404835718"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-08-04T12:06:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2084611844854128995"], "id": "2084611844854128995", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6705, "like_count": 11, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "小时候想看台偶剧，妈妈不愿意，就恐吓我：看完这些你的脑子就会化成水从嘴巴里流出来变成没脑子的笨蛋\n现在妈妈看短剧/ai短剧，我就：再看这些你马上变成脑袋里全是水的傻子！", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2084611844854128995"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-08-03T16:55:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2084322255472140412"], "id": "2084322255472140412", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 5806, "like_count": 20, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 23, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "人一旦意识到自己是个抢手货就会很完蛋！", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2084322255472140412"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-08-03T16:52:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2084321472764625351"], "id": "2084321472764625351", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4427, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 17, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "数不清第几次被试卷划破手指了 \n纸完全是利器来的。", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2084321472764625351"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-08-03T09:51:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2084215572502589746"], "id": "2084215572502589746", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6857, "like_count": 16, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 27, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "我是npc的有力证据：不会主动触发对话。只有等别人点击到我的时候才会触发聊天…", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2084215572502589746"}, {"author_id": "1900688917902282752", "created_at": "2026-08-02T10:01:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2083855618159604065"], "id": "2083855618159604065", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11219, "like_count": 44, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 93, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "我很想亲嘴呀但不想跟某个具体的人亲 就是单纯想亲嘴有人能懂吗", "url": "https://x.com/icecake999/status/2083855618159604065"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "1900688917902282752", "name": "冰煮羊", "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2106252553940013056/ohUNkUIO_normal.jpg", "username": "icecake999", "verified": false}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2092443828435509293", "next_token": "7140dibdnow9c7btwoxjdb4ea71ycqib24ouxytui1ws5", "oldest_id": "2083855618159604065", "previous_token": "77qpymm88g5h9vqkmfmv8u2rloon2128pv4mdinatndir", "result_count": 25}}